40ht|v|To be at the head of; to put one's self at the head of; to lead; to direct; to act as leader to; as, to head an army, an expedition, or a riot. ; To form a head to; to fit or furnish with a head; as, to head a nail. ; To behead; to decapitate. ; To cut off the top of; to lop off; as, to head trees. ; To go in front of; to get in the front of, so as to hinder or stop; to oppose; hence, to check or restrain; as, to head a drove of cattle; to head a person; the wind heads a ship. ; To set on the head; as, to head a cask. ; To originate; to spring; to have its source, as a river. ; To go or point in a certain direction; to tend; as, how does the ship head? ; To form a head; as, this kind of cabbage heads early.	o:2mx,59,25;kvh,52,1;3kr7,49,134;2ma,44,19;8cyp,42,12;58pg,41,12;3kr9,40,16;8crt,39,3;j3t,39,4;5s55,38,2;8cyo,37,66;459d,35,1;9eg7,34,2;1x43,33,24;8cyx,28,172~9s0f,5,251;8cyx,28,172;3kr7,49,134;8cyl,10,91;8cyo,37,66;87cn,5,33;112e,1,32;807o,19,28;2mx,59,25;1x43,33,24;2ma,44,19;9tpl,26,16;3kr9,40,16;8mxo,12,14;47qv,6,14	s:7i57,85,40;737l,75,374;2uwl,75,4;rhr,67,80;541x,65,8;9q2k,62,2;5arq,59,2;736v,59,132;8r7n,59,43;8s0z,57,48;8krt,52,88;8crv,51,109;2qni,47,1;64pu,43,6;7e3g,39,3~737l,75,374;9yq7,25,360;8cyl,21,200;736v,59,132;8crv,51,109;2ckc,16,96;8krt,52,88;3yov,17,81;rhr,67,80;9egb,7,73;71we,4,56;8s0z,57,48;8r7n,59,43;7i57,85,40;8uki,37,34	d:7z9z,58,6;10oe,28,4;8lf6,20,1;9yq7,18,215;am3u,14,14;8r7n,5,1~9yq7,18,215;am3u,14,14;7z9z,58,6;10oe,28,4;8r7n,5,1;8lf6,20,1	D:8cyo,20,21;56gc,16,2;acq7,14,4;4hu3,8,2;944x,1,197~944x,1,197;8cyo,20,21;acq7,14,4;56gc,16,2;4hu3,8,2
